   "text": "Two screens. One shooter. One problem for the defence. 🏀\n\nThe stagger screen forces a read:\n▸ Chase the shooter over the screens → caught behind, open three.\n▸ Top-lock to deny the exit → back door, easy two.\n\nThe best offences don't just run the play. They read the defence.\n\nHow would you guard it? 👇\n\n#basketball #basketballtactics #staggerscreen #basketballcoach #coaching #E2ABasketball #MoreThanAGame",
